                <invention-title lang="de">TRANSFORM-SKIP-RESTKODIERUNG VON VIDEODATEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CODAGE RÉSIDUEL À SAUT DE TRANSFORMÉE DE DONNÉES VIDÉO</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TRANSFORM-SKIP RESIDUAL CODING OF VIDEO DATA</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides systems and methods for transform-skip residual video data coding and decoding. One exemplary method comprises: performing a first pass of scanning a transform coefficient of a sub-block of a video frame, wherein the first pass of scanning comprises: bypass coding a parity level flag for the transform coefficient, the parity level flag indicating a parity of an absolute value of a level of the transform coefficient.</p>
            </abstract>
